sections.body:
The information collected and published through the Registry may include:
- Organization or partner name;
- Partner type;
- Contact person name;
- Position or role;
- Sex;
- Region and district;
- Main and other crops;
- Annual average capacity in tonnes;
- Telephone number;
- Email address;
- GPS coordinates and other location information; and
- Any other information voluntarily provided for inclusion in the Registry.

I understand that any information provided and authorized for publication may be displayed through the Registry and made available to users worldwide.

By selecting **I accept** below, I expressly and voluntarily consent to:
- The collection of the information provided for inclusion in the Registry;
- The storage and processing of such information by CIAT for purposes related to the operation of the ACCELERATE Tanzania Registry;
- The international transfer, storage, and processing of such information outside Tanzania;
- The public display and publication of the information provided through the Registry; and
- The worldwide accessibility of such information through the internet.
